    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>What The Coffin is currently in development, and we\u2019re hard at work making it the wobbliest, most chaotic co-op experience possible! Everything you see is a work in progress and subject to change as we fine-tune the physics, levels, and sheer ridiculousness. Stay tuned for updates as we bring this coffin-carrying adventure to life!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/40cfa51b3234c4208ab486ed0a37c0e6.avif?t=1742291854\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deliver Kevin To Heaven!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>What The Coffin</strong></i> follows the ridiculous journey of Kevin ... who is very much <i>un-alive</i>\u00a0... as you and a friend attempt to deliver his coffin to heaven. Working together, you\u2019ll each hold one end of the casket while navigating wild obstacles, tricky climbs, and even discovering hidden gems along the way. Just try not to drop Kevin\u2026 he\u2019s been through enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/b1f77d66ba49283d962dd1356e669b82.poster.avif?t=1742291854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/b1f77d66ba49283d962dd1356e669b82.webm?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/b1f77d66ba49283d962dd1356e669b82.mp4?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customisable Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll unlock a variety of cosmetics to customise your characters, all earned through gameplay, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hats</strong> \ud83c\udfa9 \u2013 From classy to downright ridiculous!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tops</strong> \ud83d\udc55 \u2013 Dress up or dress <i>questionably</i>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trousers</strong> \ud83d\udc56 \u2013 Because running around in just a top would be weird\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Outfits</strong> \ud83d\udc54 \u2013 Go all out with themed sets!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your style as you stumble towards the afterlife!<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/29867cab13c1d304431c79622234dd4a.poster.avif?t=1742291854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/29867cab13c1d304431c79622234dd4a.webm?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/29867cab13c1d304431c79622234dd4a.mp4?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Coffin-Carrying Champions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to be the best undertaker in the business? Compete with friends and players worldwide on the <strong>leaderboards</strong>! Race against the clock, keep your coffin steady, and prove you're the ultimate coffin-carrying duo.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fastest Times \u23f1\ufe0f</strong> \u2013 Who can <i>ascend</i> to the top the quickest?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flawless Runs \ud83c\udf1f</strong> \u2013 Less stumbling, more style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Collectibles \ud83c\udfa9</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and climb the ranks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you carry Kevin with grace, or will your journey end in disaster? The leaderboards will decide!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>What The Coffin is currently in development, and we\u2019re hard at work making it the wobbliest, most chaotic co-op experience possible! Everything you see is a work in progress and subject to change as we fine-tune the physics, levels, and sheer ridiculousness. Stay tuned for updates as we bring this coffin-carrying adventure to life!</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/40cfa51b3234c4208ab486ed0a37c0e6.avif?t=1742291854\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Deliver Kevin To Heaven!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>What The Coffin</strong></i> follows the ridiculous journey of Kevin ... who is very much <i>un-alive</i>\u00a0... as you and a friend attempt to deliver his coffin to heaven. Working together, you\u2019ll each hold one end of the casket while navigating wild obstacles, tricky climbs, and even discovering hidden gems along the way. Just try not to drop Kevin\u2026 he\u2019s been through enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/b1f77d66ba49283d962dd1356e669b82.poster.avif?t=1742291854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/b1f77d66ba49283d962dd1356e669b82.webm?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/b1f77d66ba49283d962dd1356e669b82.mp4?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customisable Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll unlock a variety of cosmetics to customise your characters, all earned through gameplay, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hats</strong> \ud83c\udfa9 \u2013 From classy to downright ridiculous!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tops</strong> \ud83d\udc55 \u2013 Dress up or dress <i>questionably</i>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trousers</strong> \ud83d\udc56 \u2013 Because running around in just a top would be weird\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Outfits</strong> \ud83d\udc54 \u2013 Go all out with themed sets!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn your style as you stumble towards the afterlife!<br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/29867cab13c1d304431c79622234dd4a.poster.avif?t=1742291854\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/29867cab13c1d304431c79622234dd4a.webm?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1930190/extras/29867cab13c1d304431c79622234dd4a.mp4?t=1742291854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Coffin-Carrying Champions!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to be the best undertaker in the business? Compete with friends and players worldwide on the <strong>leaderboards</strong>! Race against the clock, keep your coffin steady, and prove you're the ultimate coffin-carrying duo.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fastest Times \u23f1\ufe0f</strong> \u2013 Who can <i>ascend</i> to the top the quickest?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flawless Runs \ud83c\udf1f</strong> \u2013 Less stumbling, more style!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hidden Collectibles \ud83c\udfa9</strong> \u2013 Discover secrets and climb the ranks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you carry Kevin with grace, or will your journey end in disaster? The leaderboards will decide!</p>",
    "short_description": "In What The Coffin, you and a friend face the wildest challenge: hauling a wobbly corpse through a chaotic world of physics-based obstacles! It\u2019s all about coffin-cooperation. If you drop it, you're both going six feet under! Can your friendship survive the madness?",
